No, no. No faster getting of fortunes. Remember: fortunes are in some way
'most powerful' items in the game, as they add to your personal gaming
experience, not to your character's, and thus survive across games.
One of the reasons I love nethack is that even after few years of playing
I still sometimes get a fortune I've never seen before. Just recently 
I found my notes for some ancient hack (1.0.3?), including 3 pages of
'collected fortunes', with some additional comments about their meaning
- that would almost certainly never be created if I were getting a
fortune every minute...

Besides, 3.1 has added random floor engravings as an additional
source of fortune messages - we are already getting fortunes more often 
than in 3.0.

